WEBVTT

01:30.800 --> 01:34.520
=Lady Liberty=

01:35.000 --> 01:37.980
=Episode 1=

01:41.180 --> 01:42.820
Many readers are very concerned

01:43.140 --> 01:45.940
about whether the two of you
will continue working together.

01:48.900 --> 01:49.380
No.

01:55.380 --> 01:56.660
He Han, you write novels,

01:56.940 --> 01:59.540
and Zhanqiao is your literary editor.

02:00.220 --> 02:01.660
You two are a match made in heaven

02:01.933 --> 02:03.288
in the online fiction industry.

02:04.460 --> 02:05.340
If you had to

02:05.700 --> 02:09.140
use one sentence to evaluate
each other's professional ability,

02:10.260 --> 02:11.050
what would you say?

02:11.050 --> 02:11.740
A genius.

02:11.940 --> 02:12.820
Capable of anything.

02:13.000 --> 02:14.540
Well, why did you stop working together?

02:14.540 --> 02:15.500
Too much pressure.

02:15.980 --> 02:16.660
Too exhausting.

02:20.140 --> 02:20.980
(As far as I know,)

02:21.940 --> 02:24.060
(before, besides
your working relationship,)

02:24.540 --> 02:26.140
(there was also a more)

02:27.100 --> 02:28.220
(intimate one.)

02:29.111 --> 02:31.000
(To put it plainly,
a romantic relationship.)

02:31.140 --> 02:31.777
(Is that true?)

02:43.540 --> 02:44.020
No.

02:45.140 --> 02:45.620
Yes.

02:45.755 --> 02:48.500
Anyway, everything that should happen
between a couple has happened.

02:48.577 --> 02:50.622
We didn't have
a clearly defined relationship.

02:50.888 --> 02:51.740
It's hard to define.

02:53.180 --> 02:54.460
How is that not clearly defined?

02:54.460 --> 02:55.850
How else would you define it?

02:55.850 --> 02:57.300
Being together is being together.

02:57.533 --> 02:59.466
In the end, there was
still a sense of distance.

03:00.980 --> 03:02.620
(And that last bit of distance)

03:03.600 --> 03:04.620
(could not be eliminated.)

03:08.380 --> 03:09.820
(But I made up my mind.)

03:10.980 --> 03:13.940
(Life and work should
both have a new start.)

03:15.020 --> 03:16.060
(Without He Han,)

03:17.220 --> 03:17.980
(I feel)

03:18.540 --> 03:19.820
(I could be better than before.)

03:20.740 --> 03:21.980
I could be healthier

03:22.420 --> 03:23.222
and more relaxed.

03:24.260 --> 03:25.820
Will you go back to how you were before,

03:25.977 --> 03:27.340
reconcile as if nothing happened?

03:27.540 --> 03:27.940
Will you?

03:28.060 --> 03:28.940
Of course.

03:29.180 --> 03:29.580
No.

03:31.380 --> 03:32.300
But I still hope

03:33.020 --> 03:33.940
he can live well.

03:34.400 --> 03:36.300
At the very least,
can you still be friends?

03:36.500 --> 03:37.980
Who wants to be friends with her?

03:37.980 --> 03:39.460
What I lack the least is friends.

03:39.980 --> 03:40.460
Forget it.

03:41.060 --> 03:42.260
For Lin Zhanqiao,

03:42.460 --> 03:44.140
I may not be the best boyfriend,

03:44.580 --> 03:46.420
but I think
I've already done quite well.

03:47.060 --> 03:48.020
I can guarantee

03:48.820 --> 03:49.940
she absolutely won't find

03:50.020 --> 03:51.420
a better author than me.

03:51.860 --> 03:53.644
If you haven't even done your work well,

03:54.180 --> 03:55.380
why look for a boyfriend?

03:56.600 --> 03:58.066
Tame the white horse first,

03:58.444 --> 03:59.510
and then look for a prince.

04:26.860 --> 04:30.740
(Half A Year Ago)

04:51.900 --> 04:52.540
Get up.

04:53.977 --> 04:55.111
Let me sleep a bit more.

04:55.688 --> 04:58.311
Hurry up. We have an appointment
with Mr. Fan at 7:30 AM today.

04:58.400 --> 04:59.066
Get up quickly.

04:59.460 --> 05:01.540
Who schedules a meeting at 7:30 AM?

05:02.020 --> 05:02.740
Hurry up.

05:03.140 --> 05:03.700
Stop sleeping.

05:03.940 --> 05:05.220
He's Mr. Fan, not just anyone.

05:05.380 --> 05:06.300
For him, 7:30 AM

05:06.300 --> 05:07.420
is already noon.

05:07.740 --> 05:09.580
For me, it's not even dawn yet.

05:09.860 --> 05:11.460
You agreed to 7:30 AM.

05:12.460 --> 05:13.820
You agreed on my behalf, okay?

05:15.060 --> 05:17.300
No one would dare make Mr. Fan wait.

05:17.860 --> 05:18.780
Let him wait once.

05:18.780 --> 05:20.260
Everything has a first time.

05:22.940 --> 05:23.940
How about this?

05:24.540 --> 05:25.180
You go first.

05:25.377 --> 05:26.090
After you're done,

05:26.100 --> 05:27.560
you can come back and continue sleeping.

05:27.580 --> 05:28.820
Who could sleep after that?

05:31.580 --> 05:32.940
When you meet him later,

05:32.940 --> 05:33.980
don't keep a straight face.

05:35.180 --> 05:36.340
Be friendlier.

05:36.340 --> 05:37.860
After all, he's from the platform.

05:39.460 --> 05:40.860
Is my attitude that bad?

05:40.860 --> 05:42.020
Isn't it pretty good?

05:47.260 --> 05:48.340
It's all foam.

05:49.220 --> 05:49.620
Hurry up.

05:52.933 --> 05:53.911
Change into this outfit.

05:53.920 --> 05:55.220
No need. I'm already wearing long pants.

05:55.220 --> 05:56.680
That's already showing respect, right?

05:56.700 --> 05:57.540
Just wear this?

05:57.866 --> 05:59.020
Mr. Fan wants to talk to me.

05:59.020 --> 06:00.300
It's not because of my looks,

06:00.300 --> 06:01.060
don't you think?

06:05.580 --> 06:06.060
Wait.

06:08.666 --> 06:09.844
There's a high chance

06:09.850 --> 06:11.120
that Mr. Fan asked you out today

06:11.120 --> 06:12.866
because he's trying
to drive a wedge between us.

06:12.900 --> 06:13.940
He wants to poach you.

06:14.740 --> 06:15.620
So, today, you must

06:15.620 --> 06:16.740
stay firm in your position.

06:17.300 --> 06:18.340
Take his resources,

06:18.660 --> 06:19.740
but don't give him control.

06:22.060 --> 06:23.060
He's not some girl,

06:23.180 --> 06:24.400
so he can't come between us.

06:38.660 --> 06:39.220
Mr. Fan.

06:41.340 --> 06:42.340
The top author.

06:43.540 --> 06:45.330
Sorry to have you come so early.

06:45.330 --> 06:45.820
Not at all.

06:45.911 --> 06:47.740
The morning sets
the tone for the whole day.

06:47.980 --> 06:50.100
I always put the most important matters

06:50.100 --> 06:51.220
in the morning.

06:51.220 --> 06:51.620
Yes.

06:52.288 --> 06:53.622
Let me start with the good news.

06:53.740 --> 06:54.800
Your Shattered Six States

06:54.860 --> 06:57.260
is now popular on our platform.

06:57.660 --> 06:58.340
A coffee, please.

07:10.300 --> 07:11.340
At this rate,

07:11.340 --> 07:13.660
breaking the platform's

07:13.780 --> 07:15.000
reading record since its launch

07:15.100 --> 07:17.140
is not a problem at all.

07:19.340 --> 07:20.820
On behalf of the platform,

07:20.911 --> 07:21.977
on behalf of the...

07:22.620 --> 07:24.340
(Zhanqiao: Where's the face wash?)

07:26.377 --> 07:28.420
On behalf of all the readers
on the platform,

07:28.580 --> 07:30.380
I'd like to thank you, Mr. He Han.

07:30.380 --> 07:31.380
Mr. Fan, you're too kind.

07:31.380 --> 07:33.222
Our relationship
speaks for itself, right?

07:34.660 --> 07:35.780
There's no face wash.

07:35.780 --> 07:37.060
Can't you use the body wash?

07:40.066 --> 07:41.180
Someone's waiting for you?

07:41.711 --> 07:42.820
Then, let's keep this brief.

07:42.820 --> 07:43.180
Sure.

07:44.540 --> 07:45.260
Everyone

07:45.420 --> 07:47.780
is very concerned about your

07:48.260 --> 07:50.260
living situation
and working environment.

07:50.355 --> 07:52.022
So, I made
a special trip to take a look.

07:52.180 --> 07:53.580
The hotel is fine,

07:54.220 --> 07:56.660
but staying here long-term isn't ideal.

07:57.260 --> 07:58.460
The platform is considering

07:58.460 --> 08:01.340
renting a long-term apartment

08:01.900 --> 08:02.820
and arranging

08:03.260 --> 08:04.420
a dedicated cook for you.

08:04.488 --> 08:06.066
Just name whatever you want to eat.

08:07.020 --> 08:08.460
And also a private car and driver,

08:08.980 --> 08:12.300
to take care of your life in every way,

08:12.660 --> 08:13.820
so you can

08:14.140 --> 08:16.980
focus entirely on your writing.

08:17.100 --> 08:18.820
I'm very grateful, Mr. Fan,

08:19.020 --> 08:19.940
but please don't.

08:20.660 --> 08:22.020
I like staying in hotels.

08:22.500 --> 08:24.220
This hotel is just

08:24.220 --> 08:25.860
a temporary place to stay.

08:26.860 --> 08:28.140
Isn't everywhere like that?

08:29.100 --> 08:29.740
You see,

08:31.060 --> 08:32.660
talking with a writer

08:33.180 --> 08:34.500
is always so insightful.

08:36.220 --> 08:37.540
Sir, your coffee.

08:51.200 --> 08:52.540
(7:50 AM, Zhanqiao:
I'm going home for a bit. Talk later.)

08:54.500 --> 08:57.300
To better serve you,

08:58.340 --> 08:59.340
I have an idea.

09:00.000 --> 09:01.860
Let me know
if you think it's appropriate.

09:01.940 --> 09:02.340
Please.

09:04.980 --> 09:06.740
As for Lin Zhanqiao's company,

09:08.340 --> 09:09.340
we at Dingqi

09:10.060 --> 09:11.180
can consider taking a stake,

09:11.620 --> 09:13.380
investing to support your growth.

09:16.700 --> 09:18.660
So we've finally gotten
to the point, Mr. Fan.

09:19.780 --> 09:20.860
But unfortunately, there are

09:20.911 --> 09:22.620
three shareholders
in Lin Zhanqiao's company,

09:22.640 --> 09:23.644
and I'm not one of them.

09:23.740 --> 09:25.660
But you're the company's top author.

09:25.660 --> 09:26.980
You can influence them.

09:28.500 --> 09:28.980
Besides,

09:29.700 --> 09:31.100
I can fully fund it

09:32.180 --> 09:33.900
and set up a studio

09:34.060 --> 09:35.460
just for you, Mr. He Han.

09:37.540 --> 09:39.700
Your market value is different now.

09:39.900 --> 09:40.900
I can meet

09:41.020 --> 09:42.540
any request you have.

09:42.540 --> 09:43.980
Impressive, Mr. Fan.

09:55.060 --> 09:55.620
Mr. Fan,

09:57.060 --> 09:58.355
do you know how much I've earned

09:58.377 --> 10:00.250
from Shattered Six States
since it launched?

10:00.250 --> 10:02.940
Do you know how much I take
and how much Lin Zhanqiao takes?

10:03.580 --> 10:05.620
I don't know how you split it.

10:06.460 --> 10:08.500
The share between each editor and author

10:09.420 --> 10:11.620
can vary a lot.

10:11.780 --> 10:12.260
That's true.

10:13.500 --> 10:15.500
The company takes one-third first,

10:15.900 --> 10:16.700
Lin Zhanqiao and I

10:17.060 --> 10:19.220
split what's left evenly.

10:22.900 --> 10:24.060
Then, Mr. He Han,

10:24.460 --> 10:25.820
you're quite generous.

10:26.300 --> 10:27.300
It's not generosity.

10:28.060 --> 10:29.220
It's what she deserves.

10:33.180 --> 10:34.860
So, you mean

10:35.380 --> 10:36.940
you intend to stay tied

10:37.380 --> 10:38.540
to Lin Zhanqiao long term?

10:38.780 --> 10:40.820
Unless there's some special reason,

10:41.220 --> 10:42.060
that's right.

11:39.220 --> 11:39.980
What are you doing?

11:40.780 --> 11:42.340
Replying to emails. What's up?

11:43.580 --> 11:44.660
I didn't go home last night.

11:45.111 --> 11:46.260
(Proposal Revision Suggestions)

11:46.260 --> 11:46.820
So?

11:47.940 --> 11:50.380
No matter how late it was,
I would always go back.

11:50.980 --> 11:51.740
But last night,

11:51.740 --> 11:54.022
He Han said
since it was raining, I shouldn't leave.

11:54.060 --> 11:55.020
So, I stayed.

11:55.380 --> 11:57.460
So, you didn't sleep well
and came back to catch up?

11:57.780 --> 11:59.780
No, I slept quite well.

12:00.780 --> 12:02.460
But when I woke up, I realized

12:02.480 --> 12:03.990
there was no toothbrush or toothpaste,

12:04.100 --> 12:05.060
so I came back.

12:05.660 --> 12:06.820
Isn't that a good thing?

12:07.180 --> 12:07.900
If there were any,

12:07.900 --> 12:09.340
they'd be left by another woman.

12:10.260 --> 12:12.380
That's not what I meant.

12:12.580 --> 12:13.980
What I mean is,

12:14.220 --> 12:16.420
should I bring some things over?

12:16.666 --> 12:18.244
Otherwise, next time I stay there,

12:18.250 --> 12:20.580
there'll still be nothing,
and I'll have to come back again.

12:20.580 --> 12:22.400
That's so inconvenient, don't you think?

12:23.300 --> 12:24.220
What did He Han say?

12:26.460 --> 12:27.500
Do I need to ask him?

12:27.700 --> 12:29.860
It's not like I'd call him

12:29.940 --> 12:31.180
just to ask if I can bring

12:31.180 --> 12:32.540
a toothbrush and toothpaste.

12:33.700 --> 12:35.020
He should have asked you first.

12:35.422 --> 12:37.600
Otherwise, it means
he doesn't want you staying over.

12:40.180 --> 12:40.980
You know what?

12:42.260 --> 12:43.500
Last night,

12:43.580 --> 12:45.940
he was the one who asked me to stay.

12:46.220 --> 12:47.900
Of course, he had asked before too,

12:47.900 --> 12:49.260
but I never agreed.

12:49.500 --> 12:51.940
Because I think leaving at night
and leaving in the morning

12:52.340 --> 12:53.740
are different.

12:53.940 --> 12:54.980
Leaving at night means

12:54.980 --> 12:56.420
you're still dating,

12:56.500 --> 12:58.420
but living separate lives.

12:58.533 --> 12:59.711
But leaving in the morning

12:59.740 --> 13:01.260
means you've accepted

13:01.260 --> 13:02.644
that you're going to live together.

13:05.580 --> 13:06.020
Hey,

13:06.380 --> 13:07.740
are you even listening to me?

13:09.660 --> 13:11.460
Then, just bring
a toothbrush and toothpaste

13:11.460 --> 13:12.420
and go try it out first.

13:14.500 --> 13:15.620
What about the pillow?

13:16.020 --> 13:16.980
Forget the pillow.

13:32.980 --> 13:33.540
You're back.

13:34.620 --> 13:35.460
That was fast.

13:36.466 --> 13:38.700
The hotel slippers were too big
that I almost tripped.

13:39.100 --> 13:40.820
How did it go with Mr. Fan today?

13:41.740 --> 13:42.740
It was alright.

13:43.500 --> 13:44.420
Just like you said,

13:44.580 --> 13:46.466
he was trying
to drive a wedge between us.

13:46.980 --> 13:48.220
But I stayed firm

13:48.300 --> 13:49.340
and still kept it polite.

13:49.500 --> 13:50.060
You know,

13:50.300 --> 13:51.500
I did really well.

13:52.300 --> 13:53.780
What kind of riches did he offer you?

13:59.380 --> 14:00.700
Half the kingdom!

14:02.620 --> 14:04.020
Then, how did you shut him down?

14:06.380 --> 14:07.220
I told him

14:09.860 --> 14:11.700
I'd choose the beauty over the kingdom.

14:13.620 --> 14:14.220
Start writing.

14:14.311 --> 14:16.000
I'm here to remind you
to submit your draft.

14:16.020 --> 14:17.420
Beauty and the draft, both handled.

14:17.620 --> 14:18.500
Start writing.

14:18.555 --> 14:19.980
What's wrong with you? Start writing.

14:20.088 --> 14:21.500
Or you'll run out of time later.

14:21.500 --> 14:22.900
Relax, there's plenty of time to write.

14:22.900 --> 14:24.133
Just start writing, okay?

14:26.380 --> 14:26.980
Your pillow?

14:28.300 --> 14:29.940
The hotel pillow isn't very comfortable.

14:30.777 --> 14:32.244
Then, what do you sleep on at home?

14:32.380 --> 14:33.380
I ordered a new one.

14:33.711 --> 14:34.620
It'll arrive tomorrow.

14:35.460 --> 14:36.820
So you're leaving this here, right?

14:38.540 --> 14:38.980
Can't I?

14:40.333 --> 14:41.380
It's not that you can't.

14:42.220 --> 14:43.577
If you think it's not appropriate,

14:43.740 --> 14:44.730
I can take it away.

14:44.730 --> 14:46.140
No need. It's fine to leave it here.

14:47.420 --> 14:49.133
I'm not planning to stay here every day.

14:49.660 --> 14:51.100
But if I stay occasionally,

14:51.500 --> 14:53.100
without these daily items,

14:53.120 --> 14:54.440
it'll be very inconvenient for me.

14:54.460 --> 14:55.420
Yes, of course.

14:55.820 --> 14:56.260
Got it.

15:01.820 --> 15:02.460
It's fine.

15:02.900 --> 15:03.460
It's good.

15:18.220 --> 15:19.100
Alright.

15:19.460 --> 15:20.420
Start writing.

15:21.340 --> 15:22.700
Start writing. Alright.

15:22.700 --> 15:23.460
Start writing...

15:23.460 --> 15:24.260
I don't want.

15:24.260 --> 15:25.220
Start writing.

15:25.300 --> 15:27.780
It's still early.
There's plenty of time.

15:27.980 --> 15:29.940
You'll run out of time again
and get rushed.

15:30.266 --> 15:31.580
Okay, I won't bother you. Go write.

15:31.580 --> 15:32.800
Call me when you're done.

15:41.020 --> 15:41.660
Don't worry.

15:42.088 --> 15:43.700
I won't take up too much of your space.

15:43.700 --> 15:44.820
Just some sleepwear

15:44.820 --> 15:46.340
and those daily items,

15:46.340 --> 15:46.900
you know.

16:11.660 --> 16:12.700
The back...

16:35.100 --> 16:35.860
Where did you go?

16:36.660 --> 16:38.020
I went downstairs for a coffee.

16:38.066 --> 16:39.020
Drinking while writing.

16:39.220 --> 16:40.355
I'll head back up in a bit.

17:16.660 --> 17:17.700
Which cafe?

17:18.660 --> 17:19.660
I was just at Starbucks.

17:19.980 --> 17:20.780
What a coincidence.

17:20.822 --> 17:22.340
A classmate
I haven't seen in a long time

17:22.340 --> 17:23.370
suddenly came to Shanghai to see me.

17:23.370 --> 17:24.420
I'm going to meet him now.

17:26.311 --> 17:27.600
When will you come back?

17:27.866 --> 17:30.100
If we eat,
it'll probably be after dinner.

17:30.177 --> 17:31.800
Remember to submit your draft today.

17:31.900 --> 17:33.688
I know. I'll write
whenever I get the chance.

17:33.940 --> 17:34.580
I'll finish it.

17:35.460 --> 17:35.860
Bye.

18:06.777 --> 18:07.577
Morning, Ms. Lin.

18:24.200 --> 18:24.940
Morning, Ms. Lin.

18:25.300 --> 18:25.660
Morning.

18:26.977 --> 18:27.733
Morning, Ms. Lin.

18:27.866 --> 18:28.300
Morning.

18:28.300 --> 18:30.170
Keep an eye on the authors
who need to submit today.

18:30.180 --> 18:30.770
Morning, Ms. Lin.

18:30.780 --> 18:31.100
Morning.

18:31.300 --> 18:31.980
Morning, Ms. Lin.

18:32.060 --> 18:32.733
Alright, Ms. Zhao.

18:32.780 --> 18:33.850
Get it to me before the end of the day.

18:33.860 --> 18:34.850
- Morning, Ms. Lin.
- Morning, Ms. Lin.

18:34.860 --> 18:35.220
Morning.

18:36.100 --> 18:37.220
Why are you so happy today?

18:37.220 --> 18:38.140
What's the good news?

18:38.340 --> 18:38.780
Me?

18:39.180 --> 18:39.740
Am I?

18:41.066 --> 18:42.900
He Han's momentum
has been strong lately.

18:43.200 --> 18:45.066
Hong Qigong has also
been making steady progress.

18:45.980 --> 18:47.020
I'm indeed in a good mood.

18:47.660 --> 18:48.620
Aren't you the same,

18:49.020 --> 18:49.460
Ms. Zhao?

18:49.480 --> 18:50.600
Let me run something by you.

18:50.620 --> 18:52.330
At the proposal meeting later,
I'll go first, then you.

18:52.340 --> 18:52.933
How about it?

18:53.022 --> 18:53.955
Got something going on?

18:54.133 --> 18:55.490
I'm meeting Ling Yikai for lunch.

18:55.490 --> 18:56.410
I need to go early,

18:56.410 --> 18:57.355
or there'll be a line.

18:57.380 --> 18:58.850
And you still dare to go eat with him?

18:59.140 --> 19:00.940
Last time at Auntie Noodles,
it was 58 yuan,

19:01.300 --> 19:02.930
and he kept trying to get you to pay.

19:02.930 --> 19:03.860
Not every woman

19:03.860 --> 19:05.580
has men rushing to pay for her.

19:05.688 --> 19:07.900
Spending 58 yuan to have a meal
with someone you like

19:07.900 --> 19:09.260
is already a good deal in Shanghai.

19:12.020 --> 19:12.980
Ms. Zhao, sorry,

19:12.980 --> 19:13.820
may I take a moment?

19:14.540 --> 19:17.020
These are the written materials
for each project

19:17.266 --> 19:19.177
in today's proposal meeting.
Please have a look.

19:19.244 --> 19:20.590
I've placed your copy on your desk.

19:20.780 --> 19:22.180
Speak up, Ms. Lin and I don't bite.

19:22.711 --> 19:23.860
I'll present the project first.

19:23.860 --> 19:24.860
Get the projector ready.

19:25.340 --> 19:26.700
Okay, I'll go ahead.

19:27.300 --> 19:27.740
Thanks.

19:49.260 --> 19:50.880
(I am the wife of Li Weifeng
from the South China Client Division.)

19:50.880 --> 19:52.480
(Zhou Mei from the South China Client
Division is seducing a married man.)

19:52.480 --> 19:54.190
(Zhou Mei from Celian Tianxia
has destroyed another family.)

19:54.200 --> 19:55.460
(A notice to all staff of your company.)

19:59.540 --> 20:00.980
Being likable is an advantage,

20:01.500 --> 20:02.260
but sometimes,

20:02.540 --> 20:03.620
it's also a disadvantage.

20:04.580 --> 20:05.940
Everything has two sides.

20:06.820 --> 20:08.100
When I hired you,

20:08.100 --> 20:09.540
I told you what our bottom line was.

20:09.800 --> 20:11.555
Don't get involved with people at work.

20:12.220 --> 20:13.500
You've crossed my bottom line.

20:14.340 --> 20:15.060
You work in PR.

20:15.244 --> 20:17.060
How do you plan to handle
your own crisis PR?

20:17.900 --> 20:19.511
Come on, use yourself as an example.

20:19.940 --> 20:20.820
Tell me your plan.

20:21.060 --> 20:22.044
I don't have a plan.

20:23.060 --> 20:24.466
This doesn't count as a crisis.

20:25.060 --> 20:25.780
Prove it to me.

20:26.700 --> 20:27.060
Fine.

20:27.900 --> 20:29.340
Then, I need to take two hours off.

20:46.580 --> 20:47.420
You're Zhou Mei?

20:48.060 --> 20:48.580
Yes.

20:48.977 --> 20:50.400
What are you doing here?

20:50.820 --> 20:51.460
Looking for you.

20:52.100 --> 20:53.060
Do you know who I am?

20:54.580 --> 20:55.500
Li Weifeng's wife.

20:56.100 --> 20:56.860
We haven't met.

20:59.260 --> 21:01.020
But not only do you know
what I look like,

21:02.300 --> 21:04.660
but you also sent a letter
to my company to report me.

21:08.300 --> 21:09.460
How did you know I was here?

21:09.700 --> 21:10.740
Li Weifeng told me.

21:12.660 --> 21:13.660
Not only did he tell me

21:13.660 --> 21:15.780
that you go to the yoga studio
every Monday morning,

21:15.980 --> 21:17.660
but he also told me that at 6 PM,

21:17.750 --> 21:20.333
you go to Giraffe English School
to take your child to English class.

21:21.288 --> 21:23.688
The reason I didn't go
to Giraffe English School to find you

21:23.760 --> 21:26.111
is that I didn't want to
embarrass you in front of your child.

21:27.266 --> 21:29.000
The one embarrassed will only be you.

21:30.288 --> 21:31.777
I don't want to talk to you.

21:31.900 --> 21:33.500
I'll have your company deal with you.

21:34.088 --> 21:36.460
Your behavior hasn't been proper
for just a day or two,

21:36.620 --> 21:38.620
and Li Weifeng isn't the only victim.

21:38.940 --> 21:39.380
So,

21:40.288 --> 21:41.460
if you have anything to say,

21:41.644 --> 21:43.777
go explain it to your company's
Human Resources Department.

21:44.222 --> 21:45.900
Once I go to Human Resources tomorrow,

21:46.300 --> 21:48.220
Li Weifeng might lose
his job before I do.

21:51.600 --> 21:52.780
Will you buy me a coffee?

21:57.340 --> 21:57.820
Thank you.

22:05.860 --> 22:06.540
Miss Zhou,

22:07.860 --> 22:09.580
you can't rely on your looks forever.

22:10.940 --> 22:12.020
So you think

22:12.740 --> 22:14.740
it's either looks or brains?

22:15.300 --> 22:16.580
As far as I know, your company's

22:16.580 --> 22:18.100
senior management is all men.

22:18.460 --> 22:19.260
So what?

22:20.020 --> 22:21.860
Do all men behave like your husband,

22:21.860 --> 22:23.311
getting into office relationships?

22:23.620 --> 22:25.060
You were the one seducing Li Weifeng.

22:25.260 --> 22:26.580
He's a very honest man.

22:35.500 --> 22:37.420
These are all my
chat records with Li Weifeng.

22:37.660 --> 22:38.666
You can take a look.

22:40.300 --> 22:42.580
From beginning to end,
he was the one who confessed to me.

22:43.500 --> 22:45.140
I only replied when it was about work.

22:49.111 --> 22:50.660
He even tried to give me some gifts,

22:50.780 --> 22:52.022
and I didn't accept them.

22:52.266 --> 22:53.622
You're still here, Ms. Zhou?

22:53.666 --> 22:54.260
Leaving now.

22:54.355 --> 22:54.980
See you tomorrow.

22:55.100 --> 22:55.420
Okay.

22:58.020 --> 22:58.977
Going back, Ms. Zhou?

22:58.980 --> 22:59.420
Bye.

23:10.700 --> 23:12.820
Including the necklace
you're wearing right now,

23:13.577 --> 23:15.260
he originally meant to give it to me.

23:19.020 --> 23:20.700
I don't know what Li Weifeng is like

23:20.700 --> 23:21.420
in front of you.

23:21.900 --> 23:22.900
You say he's honest,

23:23.300 --> 23:24.700
but the Li Weifeng who talks to me

23:24.822 --> 23:26.555
(Long time since I slept with my wife.)
is not honest at all.

23:26.666 --> 23:28.200
(Your boyfriend doesn't pick you up.)
If I submit

23:28.222 --> 23:29.977
these messages
to the Human Resources Department,

23:30.820 --> 23:31.980
he will be fired

23:32.422 --> 23:33.820
and sued for sexual harassment.

23:34.740 --> 23:36.860
So you'd better
sincerely apologize to me now

23:37.740 --> 23:38.900
and write to my company

23:38.900 --> 23:40.410
to withdraw your accusations against me.

23:40.422 --> 23:41.844
Otherwise, I'll sue you as well.

23:46.940 --> 23:48.100
(Clear Chat History)

23:48.100 --> 23:50.488
(Confirm deletion of chat history
with Li Weifeng? Clear)

23:57.340 --> 23:58.900
I've already deleted the chat records.

23:59.460 --> 24:00.500
You have no evidence now.

24:07.580 --> 24:08.620
What did you just ask me?

24:09.420 --> 24:10.940
Who the problem lies with, right?

24:11.288 --> 24:12.060
Of course it's you.

24:12.780 --> 24:14.380
The way you look is the problem.

24:17.540 --> 24:18.580
I don't drink coffee.

24:19.860 --> 24:20.380
This one

24:22.180 --> 24:22.700
is for you.

24:36.644 --> 24:37.888
Just the two of us?

24:38.266 --> 24:39.288
Where's Lin Zhanqiao?

24:39.511 --> 24:40.844
If the three of us go together,

24:40.866 --> 24:41.900
it won't be lunch

24:42.180 --> 24:43.580
but a shareholders' meeting.

24:45.540 --> 24:47.140
You know I'm not really into food.

24:47.540 --> 24:48.420
That's because

24:48.420 --> 24:50.260
you haven't tried
anything truly good yet.

24:53.020 --> 24:53.900
Excuse me.

24:53.977 --> 24:55.100
Your dishes are all served.

24:55.100 --> 24:56.377
Please settle the bill first.

24:58.780 --> 25:00.111
One hundred twenty-eight yuan.

25:03.060 --> 25:03.500
I'll pay.

25:09.540 --> 25:09.900
Alright.

25:13.540 --> 25:15.260
Do you never treat women to meals?

25:16.100 --> 25:16.540
Not really.

25:21.580 --> 25:22.900
I often treat men.

25:26.580 --> 25:27.900
Right, you'll still need

25:27.900 --> 25:29.020
to follow up with them later.

25:29.180 --> 25:29.570
Alright.

25:29.570 --> 25:30.260
Okay, no problem.

25:30.260 --> 25:31.270
That's about it for today.

25:31.380 --> 25:31.780
Okay.

25:32.133 --> 25:33.644
Let's leave it at that for lunch.

25:33.755 --> 25:35.466
Alright, let's wrap up the meeting.

25:37.180 --> 25:37.780
Hi, Ms. Mei.

25:41.420 --> 25:43.500
- Ms. Mei, you look beautiful today.
- Hi, Ms. Mei.

25:48.177 --> 25:50.220
Dressed like that
and holding a takeaway box,

25:50.577 --> 25:51.911
doesn't it look a bit odd?

25:52.000 --> 25:54.288
There's a business event
at the company this afternoon.

25:54.511 --> 25:56.311
Did everything go smoothly
after you moved in?

25:57.340 --> 25:58.380
Didn't he act cute

25:58.380 --> 26:00.210
and ask you to go back
at noon to eat with him?

26:01.220 --> 26:03.540
He has to meet
a high school classmate at noon today,

26:03.977 --> 26:05.220
and won't be back until evening.

26:05.260 --> 26:06.800
First day of officially living together,

26:06.800 --> 26:08.400
and he's already going out
with someone else?

26:08.420 --> 26:09.970
We've already known each other so well.

26:10.100 --> 26:11.622
A day or two doesn't make a difference.

26:12.980 --> 26:13.780
But you know,

26:14.180 --> 26:15.420
it still feels a bit strange.

26:16.100 --> 26:17.460
I've been in and out

26:17.460 --> 26:19.060
of that suite many times before.

26:19.500 --> 26:20.300
But I always felt

26:20.380 --> 26:21.540
it was He Han's place.

26:22.111 --> 26:23.911
But after staying
just one night yesterday,

26:24.180 --> 26:25.060
I switched to my own

26:25.060 --> 26:26.420
pillow, slippers, and toothbrush.

26:27.300 --> 26:28.940
At least now it feels like

26:29.460 --> 26:31.020
part of that space belongs to me.

26:31.666 --> 26:33.488
So you still brought your pillow over.

26:34.740 --> 26:35.940
If I'm going to move in anyway,

26:36.044 --> 26:37.190
might as well go all the way.

26:37.260 --> 26:39.000
What's with just
a toothbrush and toothpaste?

26:39.020 --> 26:40.380
It's not like I have nowhere to live

26:40.380 --> 26:41.533
and I have to stay with him.

26:41.860 --> 26:42.740
If he doesn't want it,

26:42.940 --> 26:43.820
he can just tell me.

26:44.100 --> 26:44.620
I'll leave.

26:44.780 --> 26:45.777
If he doesn't want it,

26:45.780 --> 26:47.933
you can just walk away
with your toothbrush and toothpaste,

26:47.955 --> 26:48.555
no big deal.

26:48.733 --> 26:51.088
But with pillows and slippers,
how are you going to carry all that?

26:51.088 --> 26:52.777
He didn't say he didn't want it.

26:52.940 --> 26:53.977
Well, did he say he did?

27:30.420 --> 27:31.980
What does Li Weifeng's wife do?

27:32.666 --> 27:34.060
She's so precise and ruthless.

27:34.866 --> 27:36.700
Can those chat records
she deleted that day

27:36.980 --> 27:37.780
be recovered?

27:38.740 --> 27:39.260
No.

27:39.977 --> 27:41.980
Then, how are you
going to prove you're innocent?

27:42.140 --> 27:42.940
I won't.

27:43.044 --> 27:44.666
If she wants me to look guilty,

27:44.733 --> 27:45.977
I'll show her guilty.

27:46.220 --> 27:47.140
In a few days,

27:47.244 --> 27:48.644
she'll wish I were innocent.

27:49.180 --> 27:51.220
Better to break ten bridges
than ruin one marriage.

27:51.700 --> 27:52.620
I'm warning you.

27:52.711 --> 27:53.930
If she doesn't get a wake-up call,

27:53.940 --> 27:55.866
she won't realize
how many issues she has.

27:57.460 --> 27:59.260
Ms. Lin, Mr. He Han's
update has come in.

28:15.740 --> 28:16.260
That's rare.

28:17.340 --> 28:18.422
He went out having fun,

28:18.488 --> 28:20.222
and he still finished his daily update.

28:21.111 --> 28:22.620
What is he doing with his classmate?

28:29.540 --> 28:30.700
I'll have a roast goose,

28:31.300 --> 28:32.140
one choy sum,

28:32.900 --> 28:34.580
and a beef chow fun.

28:36.180 --> 28:37.220
And a whisky, please.

28:38.180 --> 28:39.260
Macallan 18.

28:39.820 --> 28:40.420
Single cask.

28:41.355 --> 28:42.140
Alright, thank you.

29:02.500 --> 29:03.020
Hello.

29:17.111 --> 29:19.311
I'm going out for dinner
with a classmate tonight,

29:19.340 --> 29:20.711
and I might go for a drink after.

29:20.755 --> 29:21.940
Don't wait for me.

29:22.511 --> 29:23.460
Drink less, alright?

29:24.300 --> 29:25.380
Don't worry. Bye.

29:26.200 --> 29:27.780
The Macallan 18 is a single cask, right?

29:27.860 --> 29:28.500
Yes, sir.

29:54.780 --> 29:55.460
My classmate.

30:01.980 --> 30:02.780
I mean,

30:02.780 --> 30:04.180
wasn't it better before?

30:04.540 --> 30:05.933
We worked and ate together.

30:06.000 --> 30:07.300
Just the two of us, happy,

30:07.300 --> 30:08.140
without any pressure.

30:08.150 --> 30:09.311
Now you want it to become

30:09.333 --> 30:11.180
the two of us working
together 24 hours a day,

30:11.180 --> 30:12.100
living together.

30:12.177 --> 30:13.880
If this goes on,
we will get tired of it.

30:14.020 --> 30:15.380
I'm not sick of you.

30:16.180 --> 30:17.340
So you're sick of me?

30:17.540 --> 30:18.370
No.

30:18.370 --> 30:19.500
Anyone would get tired.

30:19.500 --> 30:20.140
Think about it.

30:20.150 --> 30:21.844
It's not just my work
you want to manage,

30:21.850 --> 30:23.100
and you want to manage my life too?

30:23.100 --> 30:24.220
I'm not managing your life.

30:24.220 --> 30:25.700
You were the one who kept me last night.

30:25.700 --> 30:27.540
Yes, because it was pouring last night.

30:27.711 --> 30:29.780
But before, when it rained,
I also asked you to stay.

30:29.860 --> 30:31.060
Before, I never stayed.

30:31.733 --> 30:34.555
Leaving in the morning and leaving
at night are completely different.

30:34.740 --> 30:36.100
The reason I stayed last night

30:36.300 --> 30:37.980
was that I accepted
that our relationship

30:37.980 --> 30:39.300
could move a step further.

30:39.460 --> 30:40.250
I'm ready.

30:40.250 --> 30:42.100
I can treat this place as my home.

30:42.100 --> 30:43.220
How would I know?

30:43.660 --> 30:45.060
How would I know you're ready?

30:45.260 --> 30:46.860
Did you ever ask me if I was ready?

30:46.977 --> 30:48.140
You made the decision yourself

30:48.140 --> 30:49.220
and forced me to accept the result.

30:49.220 --> 30:50.460
And I can't have any say in it?

30:50.460 --> 30:52.020
You can. Go ahead.

30:52.020 --> 30:53.500
My opinion is that before
you make a decision,

30:53.500 --> 30:55.377
you should discuss it
with me first, alright?

30:56.422 --> 30:57.260
It's not just this once.

30:57.260 --> 30:59.555
Hasn't it always been
like this before, Lin Zhanqiao?

31:00.060 --> 31:01.980
The world doesn't revolve around you.

31:02.088 --> 31:03.460
Your pace isn't the only correct one.

31:03.460 --> 31:05.180
Just because others can't keep up
with you doesn't mean they're wrong!

31:05.260 --> 31:06.540
You don't have any pace at all.

31:06.540 --> 31:09.020
Every time you run
into a problem, you avoid it!

31:09.020 --> 31:10.180
You always say "avoid!"

31:10.780 --> 31:12.900
Is this avoiding?
I'm looking at the bigger picture.

31:13.022 --> 31:14.900
I care about you.
I don't want to hurt you.

31:15.140 --> 31:16.020
That's why I did it.

31:16.140 --> 31:17.220
So what do you plan to do?

31:17.220 --> 31:18.140
I don't know!

31:18.460 --> 31:19.500
I'm not ready!

31:19.755 --> 31:21.780
I never thought
you'd treat this place as home!

31:22.580 --> 31:23.980
I don't even treat this as home!

31:24.100 --> 31:25.700
It's just a hotel suite!

31:30.380 --> 31:32.060
Why can't you wait for me?

31:32.500 --> 31:33.420
Wait until I find

31:33.420 --> 31:35.088
a place suitable
for us to live together.

31:35.111 --> 31:35.860
Wait for you...

31:35.860 --> 31:36.980
You always say wait for you!

31:36.980 --> 31:37.820
Wait until when?

31:37.980 --> 31:40.400
When did you even start looking?
Have you even started now?

31:40.580 --> 31:42.060
Fine, you say you're not ready!

31:42.060 --> 31:44.060
Then, can't I also say
you either get ready now,

31:44.060 --> 31:45.180
or never have to get ready at all?

31:45.180 --> 31:46.380
Don't get ready, then!

32:16.140 --> 32:16.660
He Han,

32:17.980 --> 32:19.420
this is the last time I'm here.

32:19.420 --> 32:20.780
I won't come back again.

32:21.060 --> 32:22.820
I never forced you to marry me.

32:22.820 --> 32:24.980
It's not that I
value marriage that much!

32:26.660 --> 32:27.380
I just don't want

32:27.380 --> 32:29.700
to keep getting dragged into
this endless push and pull!

32:29.700 --> 32:30.940
I've had enough! I'm tired!

32:30.940 --> 32:32.220
I just want an answer.

32:32.888 --> 32:34.700
Whether it's good or bad,
together or apart,

32:34.700 --> 32:35.620
I can accept it.

32:35.740 --> 32:36.820
But what I can't accept

32:37.700 --> 32:38.620
is this ambiguity.

32:41.140 --> 32:47.140
(The Day Before)

32:51.540 --> 32:52.355
Can't get a ride?

32:54.555 --> 32:55.866
The rain is too heavy.

32:57.260 --> 32:58.900
The current queue number

32:59.420 --> 33:00.460
is 82.

33:02.111 --> 33:03.500
Then, wait until the rain stops.

33:03.733 --> 33:06.355
But the forecast says it won't stop
until tomorrow morning.

33:15.300 --> 33:16.420
Then, leave tomorrow.

33:18.500 --> 33:21.060
♪I keep asking myself♪

33:22.940 --> 33:26.420
♪What it is I should become♪

33:28.100 --> 33:31.940
♪To follow what my heart truly wants♪

33:31.940 --> 33:33.020
(Because of a toothbrush)

33:34.620 --> 33:35.420
(and a pillow,)

33:37.500 --> 33:38.340
(after that day,)

33:39.620 --> 33:40.860
(He Han and I broke up.)

33:42.420 --> 33:44.020
(Or rather, we completely fell apart.)

33:46.780 --> 33:49.860
♪Like a drifting dandelion♪

33:53.260 --> 33:53.900
(In my world,)

33:53.900 --> 33:56.111
(there is no longer a place
for someone named He Han.)

33:57.933 --> 33:59.540
(With so many people in this world,)

34:01.380 --> 34:03.500
(I will find someone willing)

34:05.100 --> 34:06.220
(to face storms with me.)

34:06.220 --> 34:09.570
♪In a flower shop at the corner♪

34:10.000 --> 34:15.970
♪Even spring borrows its fragrance♪

34:17.020 --> 34:23.500
♪Moonlight keeps me company
on lonely roads♪

34:24.180 --> 34:30.910
♪Across fields of blooms,
a boat awaits me♪

34:31.420 --> 34:38.180
♪Swaying in the shape of the wind♪

34:38.660 --> 34:43.460
♪Not waiting for calm to come♪

34:46.140 --> 34:49.200
♪I want to go on like this♪

34:50.820 --> 34:54.240
♪Moving forward, not alone♪

34:54.820 --> 35:01.190
♪This moment
is worth more than anything♪

35:01.520 --> 35:03.550
♪No need to define the distance♪

35:03.580 --> 35:08.460
♪Let trials become my scenery♪

35:09.220 --> 35:14.900
♪A life not yet full begins again♪

35:29.466 --> 35:31.466
Why are you putting
the toothbrush on display?

35:33.460 --> 35:34.220
A pillar of shame.

35:35.740 --> 35:36.820
It's a constant reminder

35:37.060 --> 35:38.020
of how stupid I was

35:38.311 --> 35:39.755
and how I lost all dignity.

35:40.700 --> 35:41.460
The same mistake

35:42.300 --> 35:44.020
should only be made once in a lifetime.

35:50.380 --> 35:51.660
There's no room to negotiate?

35:58.380 --> 35:59.980
Is it because he has other girls there,

36:00.466 --> 36:02.180
so he asked you to bring your toothbrush

36:02.180 --> 36:04.866
and pillow back so that you don't get
in the way of him seeing other women?

36:06.820 --> 36:07.300
No.

36:13.222 --> 36:15.555
Are you still working together
on Shattered Six States?

36:22.866 --> 36:25.244
For Shattered Six States,
I will find you another editor.

36:25.933 --> 36:28.222
I don't want to have
anything to do with you anymore.

36:28.300 --> 36:30.659
From now on, you stay in your hotel,
and I'll go back to my home.

36:30.660 --> 36:32.500
You write your novels,
and I'll do my editing.

36:33.060 --> 36:33.660
Lin Zhanqiao,

36:35.180 --> 36:36.780
are you turning our relationship problem

36:36.780 --> 36:38.220
into a work issue?

36:42.300 --> 36:42.780
Fine.

36:44.777 --> 36:46.100
But where are you going to find

36:46.100 --> 36:47.140
another author like me?

36:47.420 --> 36:48.820
I can find plenty anywhere.

36:50.422 --> 36:52.610
Someone who's younger than you,
more disciplined than you,

36:52.622 --> 36:54.155
better at writing than you, and...

36:54.688 --> 36:56.380
who knows how to respect their editor.

36:56.410 --> 36:57.660
You don't need to find plenty.

36:57.660 --> 36:59.020
If you find even one, I lose.

36:59.777 --> 37:00.820
Then, you've already lost.

37:01.700 --> 37:02.340
We'll see.

37:22.511 --> 37:24.540
My company doesn't only
have him as an author.

37:29.022 --> 37:31.340
I really didn't expect
you two to break up so suddenly.

37:32.340 --> 37:33.620
He Han is now

37:33.620 --> 37:34.700
our biggest asset.

37:34.940 --> 37:36.300
We don't want to lose this asset

37:36.300 --> 37:37.100
for any reason.

37:38.700 --> 37:40.340
So, is there anything we can do now

37:40.660 --> 37:42.100
to help repair your relationship?

37:43.460 --> 37:44.540
If I wanted to repair it,

37:44.580 --> 37:45.933
I wouldn't have said break up.

37:48.180 --> 37:48.940
What I mean is,

37:48.940 --> 37:50.740
we don't want your relationship issues

37:50.740 --> 37:52.866
to affect the company's
collaboration with He Han.

37:52.933 --> 37:54.155
He Han is a jerk,

37:54.820 --> 37:55.820
but to us,

37:56.020 --> 37:58.340
he is a useful jerk.

38:03.466 --> 38:04.955
Assign him a different editor.

38:06.977 --> 38:08.940
These are some
of the company's senior editors.

38:09.140 --> 38:10.140
They all really want

38:10.140 --> 38:11.340
to work with Mr. He Han.

38:12.060 --> 38:13.860
See if there's anyone
you'd like to meet.

38:14.020 --> 38:15.244
I can set it up right away.

38:18.620 --> 38:19.800
None of them is attractive.

38:21.540 --> 38:22.540
They're editors.

38:23.260 --> 38:25.380
Mr. He Han,
I'm helping you find a new editor.

38:25.580 --> 38:26.420
I know.

38:28.400 --> 38:29.740
Then, what are your requirements?

38:29.740 --> 38:31.044
I'll help you filter them.

38:33.020 --> 38:34.140
I only have two requirements.

38:34.220 --> 38:35.780
If you meet either one, it's fine.

38:35.955 --> 38:37.659
Either more attractive
than Lin Zhanqiao,

38:37.660 --> 38:38.940
or more famous than Lin Zhanqiao.

38:39.220 --> 38:39.980
If you could

38:39.980 --> 38:42.266
find someone more attractive
and more famous than her,

38:42.380 --> 38:43.140
that would be best.

38:43.940 --> 38:44.860
An attractive editor?

38:44.980 --> 38:46.100
Then you should come to me.

38:46.740 --> 38:47.820
That's easy to find.

38:49.180 --> 38:50.940
Finding another Lin Zhanqiao isn't easy.

38:51.420 --> 38:53.740
But finding a pretty girl?
That's easy, right?

38:56.620 --> 38:57.620
That's why some things

38:57.620 --> 38:59.444
really shouldn't be said carelessly.

38:59.860 --> 39:01.260
Just a couple of days ago, you said

39:02.580 --> 39:03.900
you two would never break up.

39:03.933 --> 39:05.860
And now you're acting
like strangers for life.

39:07.066 --> 39:08.420
That's quite a slap in the face.

39:09.660 --> 39:11.100
But I think it's the right thing.

39:11.740 --> 39:14.100
Writers and scholars,
carefree and romantic.

39:15.980 --> 39:17.900
I'm not here to drive
a wedge between you.

39:18.580 --> 39:19.460
Oh, come on, Mr. Fan.

39:19.460 --> 39:21.340
When have you ever
not come to stir things up?

39:24.460 --> 39:26.620
Since you're not
happy working with Chenxing,

39:26.900 --> 39:27.500
I'll buy

39:27.977 --> 39:29.020
Shattered Six States.

39:33.980 --> 39:35.540
Chenxing's people are still here.

39:39.140 --> 39:41.380
Price-wise,
I'll make Chenxing satisfied.

39:42.180 --> 39:42.740
Mr. Fan,

39:43.180 --> 39:45.100
you're trying
to take away our livelihood, huh?

39:46.020 --> 39:47.860
What livelihood?

39:48.500 --> 39:50.140
Isn't this just like ordering takeout?

39:50.940 --> 39:51.900
Whoever makes it better,

39:52.060 --> 39:53.020
you buy from them.

39:59.340 --> 39:59.780
No way.

40:00.355 --> 40:01.940
I will never sell Shattered Six States.

40:02.060 --> 40:03.355
We've all worked so hard on it.

40:03.460 --> 40:04.420
This isn't about money.

40:05.820 --> 40:06.420
Zhanqiao,

40:07.540 --> 40:08.620
this is your problem.

40:11.260 --> 40:12.860
Otherwise, you call He Han

40:13.340 --> 40:14.980
to apologize to him properly.

40:15.380 --> 40:16.620
If he forgives you,

40:17.100 --> 40:18.260
this whole thing goes away.

40:18.800 --> 40:19.820
I didn't do anything wrong.

40:19.820 --> 40:21.020
So, why should I apologize?

40:21.180 --> 40:22.140
Then, sell it to Mr. Fan.

40:22.700 --> 40:24.220
From a purely business perspective,

40:24.220 --> 40:26.111
this is indeed
a good deal for our company.

40:28.580 --> 40:29.220
I don't agree.

40:29.866 --> 40:31.266
You only have these two choices.

40:31.700 --> 40:32.380
Pick one.

40:40.580 --> 40:41.380
Pull up

40:41.488 --> 40:42.850
the data's readership numbers.

40:42.850 --> 40:44.820
You can sort them
from lowest to highest.

40:44.900 --> 40:45.977
It'll be easier to read.

40:46.044 --> 40:47.460
Take a look. Does this look better?

40:47.460 --> 40:48.333
Isn't it much better?

40:48.460 --> 40:49.780
Yes, thank you, Mr. Ling.

40:50.288 --> 40:51.460
And look at this red here...

40:51.460 --> 40:52.460
For something so simple,

40:52.488 --> 40:54.266
there's no need
to trouble Mr. Yikai, right?

40:54.300 --> 40:55.955
I'll have someone come teach you later.

40:56.380 --> 40:56.930
Thank you.

40:56.930 --> 40:58.460
Mr. Yikai, come to my office.

40:58.533 --> 41:00.111
If you don't understand,
just ask anytime.

41:00.180 --> 41:01.044
Thank you, Mr. Ling.

41:08.444 --> 41:09.866
What do you think about He Han?

41:10.260 --> 41:10.660
Sell it.

41:12.580 --> 41:14.620
Getting rid of a nuisance
and still making money,

41:14.980 --> 41:16.177
I'd be grateful for that.

41:17.620 --> 41:18.420
Then it's settled.

41:18.620 --> 41:20.660
As long as He Han agrees
to sell, we vote in favor,

41:20.866 --> 41:22.688
and Lin Zhanqiao's
objection won't matter.

41:23.900 --> 41:24.340
Agreed.

41:27.500 --> 41:28.955
But you really have no loyalty.

41:29.511 --> 41:31.180
You two were
at least college classmates,

41:31.180 --> 41:32.620
yet you'd rather stand with money

41:33.420 --> 41:34.620
than with your old classmate.

41:35.660 --> 41:37.340
Those two aren't even comparable.

41:37.466 --> 41:39.630
If it's a choice between the two,
who wouldn't pick money?

41:39.644 --> 41:40.888
And that's a lot of money.

41:43.644 --> 41:45.244
Let's have dinner together tonight?

41:46.380 --> 41:47.600
Bring your classmate along.

41:47.820 --> 41:48.860
Why always bring her

41:48.860 --> 41:50.180
when it's just us two eating?

41:51.260 --> 41:52.140
Because I'm afraid

41:52.355 --> 41:54.244
that it's just
the two of us having dinner.

41:56.100 --> 41:57.260
Have you heard this saying?

41:57.860 --> 41:58.900
The thing you fear the most

41:59.300 --> 42:00.540
is what you lack the most.

42:16.020 --> 42:17.020
What have you prepared?

42:17.860 --> 42:19.020
Just the basic materials.

42:21.100 --> 42:22.540
I kind of don't know what to say.

42:23.420 --> 42:24.500
Just keep the right mindset.

42:28.820 --> 42:29.180
Here.

42:54.940 --> 42:55.740
Mr. He Han.

43:05.090 --> 43:06.010
You know, sometimes fate

43:06.010 --> 43:07.690
just happens so suddenly.

43:09.680 --> 43:10.610
(Since we were kids,)

43:11.440 --> 43:13.360
(we've been learning in class)

43:14.440 --> 43:16.110
(how to make new friends.)

43:16.380 --> 43:17.950
The three of us
started this company together.

43:18.080 --> 43:19.950
We gave Zhanqiao
an equal share at the start

43:20.350 --> 43:21.640
because she had He Han.

43:21.640 --> 43:22.410
What do you want?

43:23.020 --> 43:24.250
Diluting her shareholding.

43:24.780 --> 43:26.250
What I'm considering

43:26.640 --> 43:27.290
is pushing her out.

43:29.040 --> 43:30.160
(I've been thinking.)

43:31.440 --> 43:34.720
(Everyone's most comfortable level of intimacy)

43:35.480 --> 43:42.810
(is probably different.)

43:43.810 --> 43:45.560
♪If the sky♪

43:46.070 --> 43:47.470
♪And the sea♪

43:48.010 --> 43:49.720
♪Turned upside down♪

43:51.280 --> 43:53.210
♪If a swimming fish♪

43:53.610 --> 43:57.000
♪Fell in love with a flying bird♪

43:58.770 --> 44:00.740
♪If back then♪

44:01.100 --> 44:05.510
♪We had never let go♪

44:06.110 --> 44:12.390
♪We wouldn't be lost in the crowd♪

44:13.510 --> 44:15.660
♪We met in a thirteenth month♪

44:15.660 --> 44:17.530
♪Held each other in a fifth season♪

44:17.710 --> 44:20.150
♪And found our way back whole♪

44:20.990 --> 44:23.160
♪So let this surging love♪

44:23.160 --> 44:27.590
♪Rise like tides that never fall♪

44:28.490 --> 44:30.670
♪If we're caught in a pouring rain♪

44:30.670 --> 44:31.760
♪That's alright♪

44:32.300 --> 44:33.050
♪If we're buried♪

44:33.050 --> 44:35.750
♪By passing years all the better♪

44:36.010 --> 44:38.190
♪At least we still can keep♪

44:38.370 --> 44:42.790
♪This one eternal photograph♪

44:58.550 --> 45:00.840
♪We're on misaligned tracks♪

45:00.840 --> 45:02.600
♪Running in opposite ways♪

45:02.720 --> 45:05.190
♪Searching all along the way♪

45:05.990 --> 45:08.150
♪For the fire of our younger hearts♪

45:08.340 --> 45:13.250
♪And the beauty lost in time♪

45:13.250 --> 45:16.770
♪This time don't lose each other again♪

45:17.010 --> 45:17.980
♪Only after loss♪

45:17.980 --> 45:20.610
♪Do we learn what truly matters most♪

45:21.020 --> 45:23.380
♪In another time and space♪

45:23.380 --> 45:24.940
♪We'll stay and walk together♪

45:24.940 --> 45:27.770
♪Till we grow old♪

45:28.730 --> 45:31.020
♪But still the sky will never♪

45:31.020 --> 45:33.690
♪Turn with the sea♪

45:36.210 --> 45:38.620
♪But still a swimming fish won't♪

45:38.620 --> 45:43.830
♪Fall in love with a flying bird♪
